Description: no upper bound on the platformdirs dependency
 Debian's platformdirs.patch requires platformdirs~=4.3.6, which dh_python3 turns into
 python3-platformdirs (<< 4.4); forky ships platformdirs 4.10 and the API fs uses
 (PlatformDirs and its *_dir properties) is unchanged.
Author: SysResEval
Forwarded: not-needed
Index: python-fs-2.4.16/setup.cfg
===================================================================
--- python-fs-2.4.16.orig/setup.cfg
+++ python-fs-2.4.16/setup.cfg
@@ -42,7 +42,7 @@ packages = find:
 setup_requires =
     setuptools >=38.3.0
 install_requires =
-    platformdirs~=4.3.6
+    platformdirs>=4.3.6
     enum34 ~=1.1.6      ;  python_version < '3.4'
     typing ~=3.6        ;  python_version < '3.6'
     backports.os ~=0.1  ;  python_version < '3.0'
